# Compass — Cursor Rules

## Repo ownership
Frontend (Lovable — DO NOT TOUCH):
  src/, public/, index.html, package.json,
  vite.config.ts, tsconfig.json, tailwind.config.ts

Backend (Cursor builds):
  backend/

Docs: docs/
Scripts: scripts/

## Architecture references
API contract:        docs/Compass_Technical_Specs.md Section 4
WebSocket protocol:  docs/Compass_Technical_Specs.md Section 5
Database schema:     docs/Compass_Technical_Specs.md Section 6
ML model spec:       docs/Compass_Technical_Specs.md Section 7
All 18 features:     docs/Compass_Technical_Specs.md Section 7.3
ChromaDB config:     docs/Compass_Technical_Specs.md Section 8
Redis strategy:      docs/Compass_Technical_Specs.md Section 9
Deployment:          docs/Compass_Technical_Specs.md Section 13

## Rules
- NEVER modify src/, public/, index.html, package.json
- All GitHub API calls only through backend/core/github_client.github_get()
- Feature names only from backend/ml/features.py — never hardcode
- WebSocket messages must exactly match Section 5 of Technical Specs
- All FastAPI functions use async/await — no sync blocking
- Every public function has type annotations and one-line docstring
- All secrets via os.environ["KEY"] only

## CORS origins
http://localhost:5173
http://localhost:4173
https://*.lovable.app
os.environ.get("FRONTEND_URL", "")

